{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n ブログを開いて下さりありがとうございます。櫻坂46の関有美子です🐱\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FPXJ5VGVE0ZTMEDP1NKS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n \n \n 櫻坂46『1st YEAR ANNIVERSARY LIVE』\n に足を運んで下さった皆さん、配信をご覧くださった皆さん、本当にありがとうございました。\n \n \n こうやって櫻坂46の1周年をお祝い出来たことがすごく嬉しいです。\n 振り返ると、もう1年かーって。\n あっという間だったなあと思います。\n \n \n 2年目も櫻坂46の応援をよろしくお願い致します！\n 私自身もっと成長した姿を見せられるように頑張りたいです☺︎\n \n \n 写真載せます📷\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FQXCM0V1NYYG2F4325FM","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n ライブ前撮ってもらったー。\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FRZ69FHEH70W42J90NVC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FT0RTBPBAHGMHJ0P4T6N","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FV1ZMVFVY9PKS66GPW0S","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FW2G5S2RE1Z6D0A60MYS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FX4JTRWXXBG1Q41PMW7B","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n おふたりとも本当に素敵で綺麗で美しかったです。\n 改めてご卒業おめでとうございます☺︎\n \n \n 写真を撮らせてもらいました！\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FY3GTRQ4RT47S65JB16K","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n すてきすぎるー。\n \n \n \n そして今回のライブから小林さんが復帰されました☺︎\n ジャマイカビールすごくかっこよかったです。\n これからまた一緒に活動できると思うと楽しみです。\n おかえりなさいー！\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0FZ3AVN6RC6DK7YW8R73M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら を撮るのに必死な私をカメラマンさんから激写されてました。\n \n 意外とお気に入り。\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G08KEDGSJ99M51R11WT6","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n みんな集合してるのにメンバーを撮るわたし。\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G17M8J7206ZK4G5EWM07","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n #ゆみこかめら\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G27N59881PMSRX3GQYWF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G390ZC6SG41Q13GS9NXW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G4AJPGNDJSCZCDY9ATCA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH0G58TCWCPJ60VX66VE1H0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n またすぐにブログ書きます。\n \n \n \n じゃあ、今日はここまでです！\n \n \n 最後までお読みいただきありがとうございました！\n \n \n 関有美子🐱             "}],"source":"archive"}